                  <td style="padding: 18px 24px; font-weight: bold;">680 Mbps - 850 Mbps</td>
                </tr>
                <tr style="border-bottom: 1px solid #fef3c7; background: #f8fafc;">
                  <td style="padding: 18px 24px;">🇹🇼 台湾 TW 高级多线调度</td>
                  <td style="padding: 18px 24px;">42 ms - 55 ms</td>
                  <td style="padding: 18px 24px; font-weight: bold; color: #16a34a;">0.00%</td>
                  <td style="padding: 18px 24px; font-weight: bold;">620 Mbps - 780 Mbps</td>
                </tr>
                <tr style="border-bottom: 1px solid #fef3c7;">
                  <td style="padding: 18px 24px;">🇸🇬 新加坡 SG 专线出口</td>
